      "solution": "from math import gcd\n\nn = int(input())\n\ncount = [0] * 10\n\nfor _ in range(n):\n    count[int(input())] += 1\n\nm = min(c for c in count if c > 0)\n\ng = gcd(m, n)\n\nprint(f\"{m // g}/{n // g}\")",
