    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">An opaque bag contains <var>n</var> balls, each labeled with a number from 0 to 9. A ball is drawn at random. What is the probability (as a simplified fraction) of drawing the least likely number?</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> An integer <var>n</var> for the number of balls in the bag.<br><strong>Next <var>N</var> lines:</strong> An integer <var>ball_nb</var> for the number on each ball (ranging from 0 to 9).</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The probability (as a simplified fraction) of drawing the least likely number.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">0 &lt; <var>n</var> &lt; 50<br>0 &le; <var>ball_nb</var> &lt; 10<br>Each <var>ball_nb</var> may appear multiple times in the bag.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">5\n0\n1\n2\n3\n4</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">1/5</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
